I was asked to create a video using curated archive footage by Matyaš Dlab (dramaturg) and Lucia Repasska (director) of D&amp;rsquo;epog. This work was made in collaboration with a Ukrainian artist, John Object.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The idea was to play with the infectious, chaotic energy that D&amp;rsquo;epog exudes. I decided to build the narrative around an understated metaphor of screens as an observation of self while slowing and stretching time.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
